{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1488412-mage-reincarnation-of-fae-request-for-help-with-ideas","id":1488412,"title":"Mage reincarnation of Fae; request for help with ideas.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-29T17:04:32-07:00","id":1488412,"title":"Mage reincarnation of Fae; request for help with ideas.","content":"So, I'm playing an odd game where I started with a Dark Ages Old Faith Mage that later let go of her avatar (handing it to a &quot;clone&quot; of herself she made that she considers her daughter) as she became one of the Fae (of Dark Ages Fae).<br /> Oddly enough, I'm playing alongside players playing elder vampires who are likely to eventually reach the modern age. It's that sort of game.<br /> I realize my character probably won't be able to continue in its current form when we hit modern times so my idea is that; at that point I'll switch to a newly awakened, probably Verbena, mage with the avatar that my old faith character used to have.<br /> <br /> My plan is to use some of the time in the current game to create some magic item that can impart my future &quot;reincarnation&quot; with all the knowledge and wisdom of my Fae self as well as its essence; and maybe leave the reincarnation some nice magical treasures and blessings and stuff like that<br /> <br /> With that in mind, what sort of things do you all think I should be trying to give the reincarnation?<br /> <br /> Out of game considerations are that:<br /> If I do my magic right, I'll probably be allowed to have spheres and arete to replicate my Fae Powers or my Dark Age Mage Powers (If I don't, all manner of consequence is possible)Apart from what I give it, I'll have a starting mage character that was a changeling before awakening and has that merit so I can still see the Dreaming.<br /> I'll be playing alongside players playing really old vampires.<br /> My Fae Character has a magical &quot;Television&quot; I got during the first game (designed using visions of the future) that shows TV shows from the future.<br /> This is probably all theoretical because it's a game where things from Exalted Vs. the World of Darkness will likely show up in the 1200s and history will likely be irrevocably derailed.<br /> <br /> I guess I'll be posting my ideas too as I come up with them. Feel free to ask any questions. I don't know what's relevant.<br /> <br /> So yeah, thanks in advance. Any ideas; even absure ones, are welcome.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 07-29-2022, 08:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T19:36:16-07:00","id":1488432,"title":"","content":"Are you the Dark Ages Fae book? Because those Fae have pretty much NOTHING to do with modern changellings. Even the Dreaming or Banality or Glamour doesnt exist in the game, it's as if they are completely different splats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T20:53:15-07:00","id":1488436,"title":"","content":"From my understanding, the Dark Ages Fae are what existed before reality changed, banality flooded the world, and the world became pretty uninhabitable to them; forcing most of them to retreat to Arcadia and leaving a bunch of stragglers that are the modern Changelings.<br /> <br /> Edit: So far, I'm thinking of leaving a Fae Holding of some sort, as many magic items as I can make, and some sort of bygone beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 07-30-2022, 02:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-30T04:56:42-07:00","id":1488449,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I feel it should be more about a bargain with the Fae. Maybe you seek immortality as one of them, but the price is your Magic. And with the Banality flooding into the world you end up trapped and forced to reincarnate as the Changelings?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-30T13:21:38-07:00","id":1488485,"title":"","content":"Well, thanks to the strangeness of the game my character was a mage (in chapter 1) who let go of her avatar to become a Fae (the current chapter of the game) and is now planning to impart all of her wisdom and a lot of her magical treasures and wealth on the inheritor of that avatar in the far future. My character thinks something horrible might happen to her Fae self since, in the current timeline, the truce between Fae courts has just ended. <br /> <br /> So it's a bit like me setting up my future character for chapter 3 of this campaign, which will be a new character but with most of my old stuff; while most of the others will be playing their old characters unless they die during the current game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 07-30-2022, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}